{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d1e2f3a4-b5c6-7890-def1-234567890abc",
    "name": "S3-F12 – Get Recommended Destinations",
    "description": "Complete end-to-end test suite for GET /api/itineraries/recommendations?userId={id}&limit={n}.\n\nRun the four folders IN ORDER:\n  1 – Setup · Users     → registers A, B, C and creates an ADMIN\n  2 – Setup · Destinations  → creates D1–D4\n  3 – Setup · Graph         → creates COMPLETED itineraries and records visits\n  4 – Tests                 → all 6 spec scenarios + extras\n\n⚠  Run on a clean DB (or delete alice/bob/carol/carol_f12 users between runs).\n⚠  All services must be running via docker-compose up.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "1 – Setup · Users",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "1.1 Register User A (Alice)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('User A registered (2xx)', function() {",
                "  pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                "});",
                "var res = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.environment.set('tokenA', res.token);",
                "var pl = JSON.parse(Buffer.from(res.token.split('.')[1], 'base64').toString('utf-8'));",
                "pm.environment.set('userAId', pl.uid);",
                "console.log('[F12] User A id =', pl.uid);"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Alice F12\",\n  \"email\": \"alice_f12@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"phone\": \"5551110001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
