    {
      "name": "4 – Tests (S3-F12 Scenarios)",
      "description": "Graph state before tests:\n  A visited: D1, D2\n  B visited: D1, D3  (shares D1 with A)\n  C visited: D2, D4  (shares D2 with A)\n\nExpected recommendations for A: D3 (score=1 via B) + D4 (score=1 via C)",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "[a] User A own token → 200 with D3 & D4",
